  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.0.0: first public release. The Users module of the iot-vn Authentication Service: the user, registration, role assignment and time zone endpoints, the signed-in-user policy and the startup endpoint check, the MassTransit consumers, the user cache, reCAPTCHA, photo upload and the hosted services. Depends on ApiFeatures.Authentications.Users.Cores (>= 10.0.0) and AuthenticationService.Commons (>= 10.2.0). A host registers exactly one Users database package (ApiFeatures.Authentications.Users.Databases.Mongo or .Postgres) and must not also reference SkiaSharp.NativeAssets.Linux (this package brings SkiaSharp.NativeAssets.Linux.NoDependencies). Versioning: the major version is the highest .NET version targeted; minor versions can be breaking, so pin an exact version.",
